            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Nexa 1.0.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Fixes a crash: a relay could close Nexa by sending it one malformed message. Nothing could be read or changed this way, but it could keep Nexa from staying open. Found by new automated fuzz testing.</li>
</ul>
